+# Renderer color transfer regression checks — 2026-10-20
+
+Patch 2473 exposes the renderer's CPU-side sRGB transfer helpers and uses the
+same decode helper for HDR scene clear colors. The helper preserves alpha and
+keeps values above 1.0 available for extended linear/HDR round trips.
+
+`RendererColorSpaceTests` checks:
+
+- HDR clear RGB decoding and alpha preservation;
+- unchanged LDR clear values;
+- sRGB decode/encode round trips from black through values above 1.0;
+- both piecewise transfer breakpoints and unchanged alpha.
+
+Command:
+
+```text
+DOTNET_ROOT=/opt/dotnet-10 DOTNET_ROOT_X64=/opt/dotnet-10 \
+  /opt/dotnet-10/dotnet test src/LibreLancer.Tests/LibreLancer.Tests.csproj \
+  --no-restore -p:UseSharedCompilation=false \
+  --filter FullyQualifiedName~RendererColorSpaceTests
+Passed: 10, Failed: 0, Skipped: 0.
+```
+
+These tests validate CPU transfer arithmetic and clear-color preparation.
+They do not prove that every retail material, particle, transparent blend, or
+HDR/LDR scene matches the original game; fixed-camera visual comparisons remain
+required.
